"ne keverd a :ref:`machine.PWM <machine.PWM>`\\ -et a P7/P8-on a "
":ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>`\\ -val ugyanabban a szkriptben."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-pure-thermal.rst:709
